B.a9R=new A.jg("no-sus-chat","NO SUS Chat","A chat with yourself for notes, links and files, kept in your own Google Drive.",B.ab1,B.agO,B.aoh)
B.a98=new A.d1("How","On the other screen, open nosus.foo/go. On your phone, open Chat, tap Open on any screen and scan the QR it shows. Match the number, then choose what that screen can open.",!1)
B.a9D=new A.d1("Your account stays on your phone","The other screen only gets the items you approve, and only while the session is open.",!1)
