B.a9H=new A.d1("How it works","It is encrypted on your phone first. The key goes in the link, after the # sign, which browsers never send to a server. The first person to open the link gets it, and the stored copy is deleted.",!1)
B.a9g=new A.d1("Limits","Up to 10 files and 50 MB together in one link. A single file can also get a short code to type in. While that code is unused, a copy of the key is kept on our server for up to 20 minutes.",!1)
