B.a91=new A.d1("How it works","Watermarked links are made from a file in one of your groups, so Send adds the file to a group first. You set how long the link works and how many times it can be opened.",!1)
B.a9t=new A.d1("What you see","Each link has a log of when it was opened. You can revoke it at any time.",!1)
B.a9_=new A.d1("In a browser","A browser cannot block screenshots. The name on every page is what points back to the reader.",!0)
B.aig=s([B.a91,B.a9t,B.a9_],t.eH)
B.agm=s(["securesend","share link","access controls","expiry","view limit","revoke","analytics"],t.s)
B.a9Y=new A.jg("watermarked","Watermarked","A link to one file that shows the reader\u2019s name on every page. You can revoke it.",B.vV,B.aig,B.agm)
B.ab3=new A.b0(63330,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9k=new A.d1("How it works","NO SUS makes one copy per reader, each with tiny wording changes that read the same. The note needs enough lines for the changes to fit; if it is too short, add a few more.",!1)
B.a94=new A.d1("If it leaks","Paste the leaked text into the leak check on your note. It tells you which copy it came from.",!1)
B.a9m=new A.d1("Notes only for now",u.fD,!1)
B.a9x=new A.d1("What it can\u2019t catch","Someone who rewrites the text in their own words can remove the changes.",!0)
B.alW=s([B.a9k,B.a94,B.a9m,B.a9x],t.eH)
B.aod=s(["canary","leak","trace","fingerprint","copies","who leaked"],t.s)
B.a9U=new A.jg("traceable-copies","Traceable copies","Each person gets a slightly different copy of a note. If it leaks, you\u2019ll know whose.",B.ab3,B.alW,B.aod)
B.aaJ=new A.b0(61657,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9y=new A.d1("Joining","Chat \u2192 Join with a link, then paste the invite link or code. You see the group name and how many members it has before you join. There is no list of groups to browse.",!1)
B.a9a=new A.d1("Starting one","Chat \u2192 New group. You become its admin. You can turn on an 8-character invite code, or invite people only with links you make.",!1)
B.a9h=new A.d1("Leaving","Open the group \u2192 Group options (top right) \u2192 Leave group. Anything you added stays with the group.",!1)
B.arh=s([B.a9y,B.a9a,B.a9h],t.eH)
B.apL=s(["community","join","invite","create group","leave","new group"],t.s)
B.a9P=new A.jg("groups","Groups","A group chat for files, with its own members and activity. You join by invite.",B.aaJ,B.arh,B.apL)
B.a9F=new A.d1("Members can","Read every file in the group, add their own, rename and delete what they added, and see the group\u2019s activity.",!1)
B.a9s=new A.d1("Admins can also","Promote and demote members, remove and ban people, delete any file, manage invite links, and delete the group.",!1)
B.a9J=new A.d1("How it is enforced","By the database, not the app. The check runs on the server on every change, so an edited app gets a refusal, not a shortcut.",!1)
B.aps=s([B.a9F,B.a9s,B.a9J],t.eH)
B.aku=s(["admin","member","permission","promote","demote","remove","ban","moderation"],t.s)
B.aa0=new A.jg("roles","Roles and permissions","Groups have admins and members. Admins manage people and files; members read and add.",B.DW,B.aps,B.aku)
B.a90=new A.d1("Adding","Open a group \u2192 Add a group file, or Send a file to the group. Everyone in the group can read it.",!1)
B.a9G=new A.d1("Reading","Tap a file to open it in the protected viewer. Chat \u2192 All files lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.a9K=new A.d1("Touch to reveal","The page stays blurred until you hold your finger on it, which stops the person behind you. Turn it off in Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security.",!1)
B.a9B=new A.d1("What this does not do","Group files are not end-to-end encrypted. They are stored on our server and access is checked by database rules. For that, send a One open link instead: it is encrypted on your phone.",!0)
B.aoG=s([B.a90,B.a9G,B.a9K,B.a9B],t.eH)
B.aiG=s(["file","upload","pdf","vault","all files","viewer","study desk"],t.s)
B.a9Q=new A.jg("secure-documents","Files in groups","Files in a group open in the protected viewer, marked with the reader\u2019s name.",B.ce,B.aoG,B.aiG)
B.a9q=new A.d1("Watermarks","Your email and the time are drawn over every page you open. A photo of the screen carries them too, so a leaked page points back to who opened it.",!1)
B.a8X=new A.d1("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.a93=new A.d1("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
B.ajE=s([B.a9q,B.a8X,B.a93],t.eH)
B.aoy=s(["watermark","screenshot","screen record","capture","leak"],t.s)
B.a9T=new A.jg("watermarking","Watermarks and screenshots","Open files carry your name on screen, and on Android screenshots are blocked.",B.vV,B.ajE,B.aoy)
B.aaK=new A.b0(61697,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9i=new A.d1("What is recorded","Joins and leaves, files added, renamed, deleted and opened, screenshot attempts, and admin actions. It records who and when, never what a file says.",!1)
B.a9c=new A.d1("Visible to everyone in the group","Members see what admins do as easily as admins see members. Nobody gets a private log.",!1)
B.a8Y=new A.d1("Tamper evidence","Entries are chained, so removing or editing one breaks the chain. Nothing can be quietly taken back, including by admins.",!1)
B.aq2=s([B.a9i,B.a9c,B.a8Y],t.eH)
B.arn=s(["audit","log","activity","history","who opened","tamper","security alerts"],t.s)
B.a9Z=new A.jg("audit-log","Activity","A record of what happened in your groups and on your account. Settings \u2192 Activity.",B.aaK,B.aq2,B.arn)
B.aaN=new A.b0(62005,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9p=new A.d1("What you can hear about","Invites and join requests, role changes, admin actions that affect you, files added to your groups, and security alerts. Turn each one off in Settings \u2192 Notifications.",!1)
B.a9A=new A.d1("Nothing sensitive on the lock screen","A notification names the group and what kind of thing happened, never a file\u2019s name or what it says.",!1)
B.a95=new A.d1("If you said no to the permission","Android asks once. Everything still shows under the bell in the app, and Settings \u2192 Notifications has a button to open the system setting.",!1)
B.aiZ=s([B.a9p,B.a9A,B.a95],t.eH)
